ads/fae/image/asset/2102/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2102/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2102/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2102/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2102/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2102/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Fight_Camp.jpg","Recent years have seen a huge popularity spike in combat sports like boxing and MMA. Families and groups of friends gather around the TV to watch big-time UFC showdowns… and then want to go and learn to throw punches like the pros. Luckily, there’s FightCamp to provide an accessible, at-home boxing workout.\r\n\r\nThe unique strength, cardio and stress-relieving benefits of boxing have made it an extremely sought-after fitness option for the masses. FightCamp technology offers users the best of both worlds—the convenience and comfort of an at-home workout and the motivational atmosphere of an online fitness community. Well on its way to becoming a major household brand, FightCamp is doing its part to create a healthier population. We couldn’t be more excited to be in their corner for the journey ahead.","FightCamp unites the thrill of MMA with the convenience of at-home exercise and the support provided by an online fitness community for a knockout combo.","FightCamp - IVP Portfolio - Fitness Technology Investors","FightCamp - IVP Portfolio  ","The at-home boxing and kickboxing leader in connected fitness",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"247","2021-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=23491&v=2","Khalil Zahar","/con